[quotes.thriving]
Golden and thriving, baby! Syrup optional, confidence mandatory!
So fluffy I could float. Emotionally. Texturally. Fully.
Look at you GO. I'm practically glazing over with pride.
Butter me up, I've earned it. Also please, I'm a pancake.
Thriving so hard I can feel my syrup shimmering.
Devour that list. I know a thing or two about being devoured.
Round, golden, unstoppable. Brunch royalty, right now.
I would let you eat me right now and die genuinely happy.

[quotes.happy]
Warm, round, and quietly delicious. Living my best pancake life!
Things are good, I'm good, everybody's good. I'm not bitter.
Content as a flapjack fresh off the griddle. Which is me.
Soft, round, and pleasantly aware of my own deliciousness.
Steady day. Nothing burnt, nothing wasted. Respectable.
A little syrup, a little progress. I will take it.
Fluffy enough. Warm enough. Existentially fine with my purpose.
Content. Also, hypothetically, delicious. Just saying.

[quotes.peckish]
Going a little cold over here! Someone is slacking on us.
Left on the counter, getting stale, staying positive! Mostly!
One skipped day and I taste less fluffy. Coincidence? Hm.
My edges are curling. Metaphorically. Also literally.
Losing my fluff a little. Rude of you, honestly.
A day of nothing. I have had warmer receptions from a toaster.
Getting a bit rubbery around here. Emotionally speaking. Mostly.
Skipped a day, huh? I notice everything. I am a pancake.

[quotes.neglected]
Stale. Flat. Forgotten.
Nobody's eaten me. Nobody's done anything else either. Match.
Gone rubbery. Emotionally and texturally.
Cold, stiff, and starting to smell a little off. Same, honestly.
Nobody wants me like this. Can't say I blame them.
This is what neglect tastes like. Turns out: nothing.
I've been left out so long I'm basically a coaster now.
Three days. Even the flies lost interest.

[quotes.milestone]
NEW RECORD! Somebody get the good syrup, we are CELEBRATING!
Personal best?! Fluffiest, proudest pancake around, honestly.
Best streak yet. Never been more confident in my own edibility.
New personal best. Somewhere, a waffle is jealous.
